# Implementation Plan: Cloud-First Analysis (NotebookLM)

To provide a faster and more robust graph visualization and data analysis, I am pivoting from local Cosma (which is blocked by data quality issues) to **NotebookLM**.

## Proposed Changes

### [Cloud Workspace]

#### [NEW] NotebookLM Notebook
- Create a new notebook titled "Ecosistema Fintech Global".
- Sync project data (Markdown files from `Empresas`, `Asociaciones`, etc.).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
1. Call `mcp_notebooklm_notebook_list` to verify server authentication.
2. Call `mcp_notebooklm_notebook_create` to initialize the workspace.
3. Sync data via `mcp_notebooklm_notebook_add_text` (if needed for small files) or direct Drive import.

### Manual Verification
1. User verifies the interactive graph and chat interface in the [NotebookLM Web UI](https://notebooklm.google.com/).
